Troubleshooting common exam snags (practical tips)

If Terraform apply fails because default VPC is not present: create a VPC and subnet resources in Terraform or modify data.aws_vpc.default to target a specific VPC id.

If ssh fails with Permissions 0644 error on Windows, use Git Bash or run the PowerShell icacls commands shown earlier.

If Jenkins cannot run ansible-playbook, ensure ansible is installed on the Jenkins machine and the Jenkins user can read the private key.

If GitHub webhook shows 403 on delivery, confirm Jenkins is reachable from the internet (no corporate firewall blocking port 8080). For public access, ensure EC2 instance has public IP and SG allows port 8080.

When an AMI name pattern changes, the data.aws_ami filter may need the correct name pattern for the newest jammy images — you can search the Ubuntu Cloud Images locator or use the AWS CLI to verify. 
